# Test data
test-emails/
*.eml
# ...but not the MIME corpus. These five are postal-mime's own test fixtures,
# byte-identical and MIT-0, and the parity tests and benchmarks read them at
# module load — without them CI dies with an ENOENT that names a path rather
# than the rule that hid it.
!packages/ts/test/mime/fixtures/*.eml
